bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_svg_fractional_size_and_middle_2026-11-28, 0, "Chrome 159, k=4, Liberation Sans 16px/1.5: <svg width=49 viewBox='0 0 4 1'> is 12.25px high (rect rows 501..549, Simple 502..549 from column 93 not 89); width=50 viewBox='0 0 3 1' is 16.65625px (rows 723..788, Simple 722..789); width=40.5 height=20.3 is 162x81 device px with a 107-row line (Simple 160x80, 106). A vertical-align:middle atomic (svg, inline-block, button, input) sat on k x the CSS-snapped top: 1 device row high for 40x20, 3 for 40x21."
    web_render_svg_fractional_size_and_middle_2026-11-28, 1, "Causes: presentational_attr_decls truncated a decimal width/height attribute to whole px; the replaced-box branch of layout_with_style_flow returns before the block return that records a fractional height; the svg rect shapes were lowered in whole CSS px; align_inline_line_device_dy skipped middle boxes."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    web_render_svg_fractional_size_and_middle_2026-11-28, P2, fixed, "web render: an inline svg loses its fractional size; vertical-align middle sits on the CSS-px row at k>1", src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/simple_web_html_layout_renderer_layout_engine.spl, 2150, test/01_unit/browser_engine/svg_fractional_size_and_middle_4x_chrome159_spec.spl, 2026-11-28, 2026-11-28, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_svg_fractional_size_and_middle_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28 frac-float-svg lane: fixed. An svg's plain decimal attribute maps to a fractional px length; the replaced branch keeps the fraction of an authored or viewBox-ratio height (svg_exact_content_size_milli, min/max clamps applied there for layout and paint alike) as device extra height at k>1, the snapped px at k=1 and an end residual for the block cursor / float context; fractional svgs paint their rects on the device grid from the snapped origin at the exact scale (device-rect); middle boxes centre half an x-height above the device baseline of the baseline-aligned boxes. Specs: svg_fractional_size_and_middle_4x 1/8 -> 8/8 (in-development tag removed), svg_fractional_size_interactions 3/9 -> 9/9."
    web_render_svg_fractional_size_and_middle_2026-11-28, 1, "close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/browser_engine/svg_fractional_size_and_middle_4x_chrome159_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/browser_engine/svg_fractional_size_interactions_chrome159_spec.spl"

